 "remarks": "INVESTORS ONLY! Long term tenants in place. Manhattan-style 1BR, 1BA apartment with incredible 14th-floor views of Downtown Stamford. This unit features engineered hardwood floors throughout, a kitchen with Samsung stainless steel appliances, and a breakfast bar that opens to a living/dining area ideal for entertaining. The spacious bedroom includes a large walk-in closet, and updated double entry bathroom. Additional highlights include central air, plenty of natural light, and beautiful sunset views. Located in The Biltmore, a premier high-rise condominium, residents enjoy a 24-hour concierge, fitness center, shuttle service, community room, laundry room, storage, 4th-flr courtyard, dry cleaning, and a pet-friendly environment. Secure garage parking is available for approx. $119/mo per car. Conveniently located near I-95, Metro-North, Merritt Parkway, and just steps from the vibrant Bedford Street and Pickleball America, one of the largest indoor pickleball venues in the US, this condo offers the best of city living in the heart of Stamford!",
